<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>
Results of the one-vs-rest attack when the adversary has access only to its target model’s generations.
We report per-model <em id="A2.T3.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">top-1 accuracy</em>, <em id="A2.T3.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ROC–AUC</em>, and <em id="A2.T3.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">TPR</em> at two operating points (FPR<math id="A2.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=2\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=2\%</annotation></semantics></math> and FPR<math id="A2.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=5\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=5\%</annotation></semantics></math>).
